data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":82,"item_id":"rs_06c7cccdf15eb6f8016acbd8d834048197b9caaaf9fe8b0d21","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Planning test updates**\n\nI'm considering how to add tests for selection preservation. I want to ensure that all keys are restored properly and that eligibility is checked for both deleted and disabled items. It seems crucial to confirm that deleted items behave as expected, particularly if they’re marked as \"existing.\" I think it would also be helpful to update the documentation accordingly. It feels like a thorough approach will help everything function smoothly!"}

